ion, the terrestrial water cycle and water resources, ecosystem network observation and modeling, and Chinese agricultural policy. Through research in these domains, the institute aims to solve major natural resource and environmental problems related to national sustainable development and improve its own innovative capacity at the same time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'http://english.igsnrr.cas.cn/',NULL,3,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','87823587b5e6432ea3f620a2d62b8e2f27ce098acf25341c315425c505f34ac8','c7f73013093e00df37ff7e505654906c7b5c891ca099f8fade18b66c6e6d4abd',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='http://english.igsnrr.cas.cn/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
