AAS” (Layers of Protection Architecture for Autonomous Systems). After three years of research, the closing event of the project took place today at Fraunhofer IESE in Kaiserslautern.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'https://www.iese.fraunhofer.de/en/media/press/pm-2024-06-11-project-completion-lopaas.html',NULL,1,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','7dd74d5eaa8cacada275eb200e0fdff2fb9c5c32729db7062db838b0910812ed','3f9d0674c75905c2e080922ea3a7bfe0e8216b45bbea10814717ebe5191dac63',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='https://www.iese.fraunhofer.de/en.html' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
